'''Cats in Love''' (バレンタインイベント, ''Barentain Ibento'', '''''Valentines DDay''''') is the Valentine's Day event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]]. The '''Attack of the Lonely Hearts''' stages were later added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''The Season of Love begins in the Cat Empire!'''}}

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Between February 15th (11:00AM~) and  March 1st, 2021 (～10:59AM)'''}}, check out new Valentine's Day events during {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cats in Love'''}}, including a new Rare Capsule set and gauntlet stages!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited Edition Valentines' Rare Capsules'''}}<br>
Recruit your favorite cuties with all new Valentine's style and new abilities!<br>
Get Uber Rare heroes like {{Color|#FF0000|'''Sweet Aphrodite'''}} and {{Color|#FF00CC|'''First-Love Myrcia'''}}, or limited Super Rare {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Valentine's Neneko'''}}, only available in this set!

{{Color|#339966|'''・Get your hands on these sweet new heroes including:'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Sweet Aphrodite (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Long-range Area Attack specialist who delivers massive damage vs. Red & Black enemies!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''First-Love Myrcia (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Might Dodge Red/Floating attacks, with 100% Wave Attack!<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Valentine's Neneko (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Shoots Mini-Waves that sometimes Critical!

Plus, other Uber Rare beauties appear in this set as well!<br>
・{{Color|#FF6600|'''Narita Kaihime'''}} from "Sengoku Wargods"<br>
・{{Color|#800080|'''Sharpshooter Saki'''}} from "Dark Heroes"<br>
・{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Nurse Cat'''}} from "The Dynamites"<br>
・{{Color|#008000|'''Princess Kaguya'''}} from "Ultra Souls"

Recruit your favorite Valentine's Gal and let the season of romance begin!

※ The Uber Rare units listed above will have a set chance appear from Rare Capsule draws during this New Years event.<br>
※ Please be aware that you are not guaranteed to receive an Uber Rare-level unit when drawing during this event.<br>
※You must upgrade to the most recent versions of The Battle Cats app to access this Valentines Gals set.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited Event Stages!'''}}

Get 30 Cat Food by clearing all stages on the Sweetest Sorrow map!

Plus, clearing any stage will give you a small chance of collecting the limited-edition character {{Color|#00CCFF|'''"Marshmallow Cat"'''}} as a drop reward!

Later stages in the map will give you an even better chance, or you can use a Treasure Radar to immediately receive the reward upon stage clear!


※ Users who have previously cleared the stages in this event will not be eligible for Cat Food rewards already received.

※ After unlocking Marshmallow Cat, you can activate it by visiting the Rare Cat section of the Upgrade menu.

※You must upgrade to the most recent versions of The Battle Cats app to access event content.


{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Valentine Day Gauntlet Challenge!'''}}<br>
Visit the Event/Legend Stages during this Cats in Love event to take on new gauntlet challenge stage series A Colossal Valentines'''}}!<br>
Fight your way through 20 Choco Chaos stages, each one tougher than the last, with bigger and better rewards the further you go!

※ After clearing a stage from this map, there will be a brief cooldown period before the next gauntlet stage can be accessed.<br>
※ If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats app.


{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Login every day during the Event for bonus login rewards!'''}}

Get another stamp on your first login each day to unlock bigger and better rewards, including a Rare Ticket and useful in-game items!

※ Up to 14 stamps can be collected throughout the event.

※You must upgrade to the most recent versions of The Battle Cats app to access event content and collect rewards.

