==Trivia==
*Prior to 2021, this event was known as Sweetest Sorrow.
*This event introduced the [[Timed Score Reward]] system to [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].
*Despite them having been completely replaced by the [[War on Valentines#War on Valentines|War on Valentines]] stages in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], Mallow March, Marzi Pain and Cavity Creeping are still used in the example screenshot for the Timed Score Stages section of the main help page.

